  "description": "The Rose Sneak 1 EQ HighStep gets you through the city easily and sportily. With a direct riding feel, it is suitable for the commute to work and quick errands. Thanks to the EQ equipment, the bike is already equipped for everyday life from the factory: Integrated lighting, a luggage rack, a rear stand, mudguards and a bell provide additional comfort and functionality. The high-quality Ergon grips and the comfortable Ergon saddle complete the equipment. Characteristics and advantages The Rose Sneak 1 EQ HighStep combines a Shimano Cues 4000 gear system with 1x9 gears, Pirelli Angel DT Urban tyres and integrated lighting. The high-quality components from renowned manufacturers combine equipment tailored to urban use with reliable function. At just 13.8 kg*, the urban bike is light, agile and fast for sporty riders who cover short distances and quick routes in the city. • 1x9 gear system for uncomplicated shifting • Carbon fork and Pirelli Angel DT Urban tyres • Optimal equipment for your urban everyday life Ideal for • Quick errands and short routes in the city • Sporty commuting on asphalt and paved paths • Journeys to the office, to appointments or to sport • Movement in everyday life as an alternative to driving by car • City journeys in any weather Less suitable for • Large loads • Long cycle tours and bikepacking • Unpaved forestry tracks and jumps Equipment The Rose Sneak 1 EQ HighStep is supplied fully equipped and features an Ergon SF20 saddle, Hebie Alumee mudguards and integrated lighting. Ergon grips, a bell and hydraulic brakes from Shimano are also part of the equipment. The carbon fork and Rose pedals complement the lightweight concept of the urban bike and make it practically usable for the daily commute on roads and paved paths. Note: Weight: approx. 13.8* kg, may vary by up to +/- 5% due to manufacturing tolerances. Weight for frame colour Berry, size M, without pedals",
